sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as OGXServer Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as OGXServer Controller
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant DistReg as distributions.json
    participant OGXPod as OGX Server Pod<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Praxis as Praxis Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Registry as Container Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 1: OGXServer Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply OGXServer CR<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS (service-serving-cert)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Allowed / Denied
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created/rejected

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (OGXServer changed)<br/>HTTPS/6443 SA token
    Controller->>DistReg: Resolve distribution image
    Controller->>Registry: OCI label inspection<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Registry-->>Controller: Distribution config
    Controller->>Kustomize: Render manifests<br/>(in-process, no network)
    Kustomize-->>Controller: Rendered YAML
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply<br/>HTTPS/6443 SA token<br/>field owner: ogx-operator
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Applied resources

    loop Status Polling (periodic)
        Controller->>OGXPod: GET /v1/providers<br/>HTTP/8321 (no auth)
        OGXPod-->>Controller: Provider status
        Controller->>OGXPod: GET /v1/version<br/>HTTP/8321 (no auth)
        OGXPod-->>Controller: Version info
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer status<br/>HTTPS/6443 SA token
    end

    Note over Client,OGXPod: Flow 2: Praxis-Fronted Inference Request

    Client->>Praxis: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS, User auth
    Praxis->>OGXPod: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8321 (cluster-internal)<br/>x-user-id + x-tenant-id headers<br/>NetworkPolicy restricted
    OGXPod-->>Praxis: Inference response
    Praxis-->>Client: Response

    Note over K8sAPI,Controller: Flow 3: Platform Module Deployment

    participant PlatformOp as ODH Platform Operator
    participant ModuleCtrl as OGX Module Controller

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create OGX CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI->>ModuleCtrl: Watch event (OGX CR changed)<br/>HTTPS/6443 SA token
    ModuleCtrl->>K8sAPI: Deploy operator resources<br/>(CRDs, RBAC, Deployment, Webhooks)<br/>HTTPS/6443 SA token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleCtrl: Resources applied
